# A module of defect 2143's third case (2026-10-25, M-rechecked-issues): a
# parameter wider than the header's `int`, the only binding of this module,
# so no constant is bound by two modules (defect 2208).

extern "fixedbugs-2128-narrow.h"
    function narrow(x: i64) -> i32  #~ ffi_parameter_type

function got() -> i64
    return to_i64(narrow(x: 3)).must()
